  "title": "Air Station Barbers Point conducts medevac off Island of Hawaii",
  "description": "A Coast Guard Air Station Barbers Point Dolphin MH-65 helicopter aircrew conducts a medical evacuation 30 miles south-west of of Kona, Island of Hawaii, Sept. 28, 2021. A crew member aboard the fishing vessel Monterocio had suffered a leg injury and the Dolphin aircrew brought him back to Kona before transferring him to an Air Station Barbers Point HC-130 Hercules to be transported to Oahu. (U.S. Coast Guard video by Petty Officer 2nd Class Matthew West)",
